meta {
  name: 02_RequestCounts
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: The requester and the organization count their requests

    Given the service owner has created a draft package request for the requester
    When the requester counts its sent drafts
    Then the count matches the number of drafts in the sent list, including the new one
    When the organization counts its received drafts
    Then the count matches the number of drafts in the received list, including the new one
    And the requester cannot count the organization's received requests
    When the service owner withdraws the draft

  The counts are compared with the matching list endpoints instead of fixed numbers,
  since every run leaves a withdrawn request behind and other suites may have open
  requests at the organization.
}
